      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/oak-leaf-tx",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Growth followed as Little Creek and Lark Lane subdivisions joined in 1987, Willow Creek Farms in 1998, and Chapman Ranch Estates in 2000.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
