      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Oak Leaf sits in northern Ellis County, bordered by Ovilla, Glenn Heights, and Red Oak, 11 miles north of Waxahachie and 20 miles south of downtown Dallas.",
